!! skins ~ cli

<<~ ahu slot=`#/skins/cli`>>

!!! lares act

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`skin` name=`cli` params=`spells/[[lares act]] ~ the terminal; no verb word stands, the --draft flag names the pull`>>
```

